ng?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N01BcF5uYDIQ7kNvwEKvKbA&_nc_oc=Adrj5RB3v4lk6HFoiCcJFPF_6PDX9RTlsRm2EGLXicoIeGRnCIvHrm2tXtklu-hv5gE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR7M8afylEcM9tO3j9PL6vsIg1PgIY0ytnDueXP5MqftA&oe=6AFF0160"}, "display_name": "Ocean Rift (Go)", "keywords": ["dinosaurs", "dolphins", "ocean", "sharks", "underwater"], "long_description": "Ocean Rift is the world's first VR aquatic safari park. Explore a vivid underwater world full of life including dolphins, sharks, turtles, sea snakes, rays, whales, manatees, sea lions and even dinosaurs! You can swim around and explore each habitat using gamepad or touch controls. This full version contains 12 habitats ready for you to explore.\n\nActivate the education mode to learn more about the animals you come across. There are over 40 fully narrated information points to find.", "short_description": "Ocean Rift is the world's first VR aquatic safari park. Explore a vivid underwater world full of life including dolphins, sharks, turtles, sea snakes, rays, whales, manatees, sea lions and even dinosaurs! This full version contains 12 habitats ready for you to explore."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "180963814793573", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ocean Rift \u30aa\u30fc\u30b7\u30e3\u30f3\u30fb\u30ea\u30d5\u30c8", "keywords": ["\u6050\u7adc", "\u30a4\u30eb\u30ab", "\u9b5a", "\u6c34\u65cf\u9928", "\u6d77"], "long_description": "Ocean Rift (\u30aa\u30fc\u30b7\u30e3\u30f3\u30fb\u30ea\u30d5\u30c8) \u306f\u4e16\u754c\u521d\u306eVR\u6c34\u65cf\u9928\uff01\n\u751f\u304d\u7269\u304c\u3044\u3063\u3071\u3044\u306e\u6c34\u4e2d\u4e16\u754c\u3092\u63a2\u691c\u3057\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002\n\n\u6d77\u306e\u5e95\u306b\u306f\u30a4\u30eb\u30ab\u3001\u30b5\u30e1\u3001\u30ab\u30e1\u3001\u30a6\u30df\u30d8\u30d3\u3001\u30a8\u30a4\u3001\u30af\u30b8\u30e9\u3001\u30de\u30ca\u30c6\